qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901362,\"title\":\"Trolls Band Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkpPTZUdq31UGDovmszsg2CchiI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12903,\"title\":\"Scooby-Doo! and the Goblin King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jscb7MiWTYBjKlAb9TuNnFMSR81.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/llm8JA9OnDI29exEvBlriO5Lsjj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Scooby-Doo and Shaggy must go into the underworld ruled by The Goblin King in order to stop a mortal named The Amazing Krudsky who wants power and is a threat to their pals: Fred, Velma, and Daphne.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":939210,\"title\":\"Blue's Big City Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sAYBC3WhhiX25629HLpCvkpGk9q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/17sIiv4LGapYnyvdpKxA1vozBqY.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Josh gets the opportunity of a lifetime to audition for Rainbow Puppy’s Broadway musical, Josh and Blue skidoo to NYC for the very first time where they meet new friends and discover the magic of music, dance, and following one’s dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":756403,\"title\":\"Riverdance: The Animated Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i6TRDlVuuEXMyLSlIkDd8YhBN0r.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qqthj8EUL4QKlDBoMcPqeWvi6Ya.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Irish boy named Keegan and Spanish girl named Moya journey into a magical world of the Megaloceros Giganteus who teach them to appreciate Riverdance as a celebration of life. Based on the stage show phenomenon of the same name and featuring Bill Whelan’s multi-platinum Grammy Award-winning music.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333667,\"title\":\"Rock Dog\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7RXi2afiNJGU8EB79SD8HYoSz4O.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vHiTIgoIoF1rjnjeC4n3qYaZ7Ua.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a radio falls from the sky into the hands of a wide-eyed Tibetan Mastiff, he leaves home to fulfill his dream of becoming a musician, setting into motion a series of completely unexpected events.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15173,\"title\":\"Jonah: A VeggieTales Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJ6ImpQIqZxBh4eE2813ljQ0TQ3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f02gitQgX3QocVeeqgak8U6LZB4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Get ready as Bob the Tomato, Larry the Cucumber and the rest of the Veggies set sail on a whale of an adventure in Big Idea's first full-length, 3-D animated feature film. This is the story of Jonah and the Whale as you've never seen it before - a story where we learn that one of the best gifts you can give - or get - is a second chance.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":653247,\"title\":\"Turu, the Wacky Hen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xaG10x1C8dCHkNumSslH6jwzvpt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tyKtvW3bTv8qTL5eIN8iY8VZBcD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Like a love song to differences, Turu, the Wacky Hen tells the story of a creature who, due to her particular appearance, becomes the object of ridicule for the rest of the henhouse. Her wiry legs and featherless back don’t startle Isabel, an ex music teacher who picks her for being so special. Turuleca doesn’t lay eggs because her hidden talent is another: she talks, she sings and she dances, giving it her all. Turu, the Wacky Hen is a full-color, animated party that invites us to move our bodies to its musical numbers, making us sing verses that have the power to turn us into children once again, if only for a little while.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":71571,\"title\":\"Totò Sapore and the Magical Story of Pizza\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sARJMq4T4ftHxr1oZOhUcbR0pEX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8LNd3dsgl0QyGpOKkwzj47y9Bhe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Naples, 18th century. Salvatore \\\"Totò\\\" Sapore, an unemployed minstrel, always manages to cheer up the hungry with his songs about good food, always upsetting Vesuvia, a magma witch who lives inside the Vesuvius.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40619,\"title\":\"Day & Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn2tOtidoYZ0D56jR4yknpdP1mU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i05QKKn8GqAdmQSeAztxhuqN6dt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Day, a sunny fellow, encounters Night, a stranger of distinctly darker moods, sparks fly! Day and Night are frightened and suspicious of each other at first, and quickly get off on the wrong foot. But as they discover each other's unique qualities--and come to realize that each of them offers a different window onto the same world-the friendship helps both to gain a new perspective.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21865,\"title\":\"Santa vs. the Snowman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y2xHNOeqsP0V6zi5KVAocBoQZwI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y6QX7e0icgEAnuSe3y0KOTlCoCz.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A lonely snowman finds Santa's workshop. But when he sets off the perimeter alarms and is chased away, he wonders why he couldn't be Santa and get all the love and fun this year. With the aid of \\\"Snow Minions Made Easy\\\", he pits his snow army against Santa's elves and captures Santa. But can he really do Santa's job?\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40623,\"title\":\"A Town Called Panic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Q1jtFU1zutKsAR9lwAl6YMkgZM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xK7GbENFsJqqMUs6orrGAqEpO29.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cowboy and Indian's only wish was to come up with a brilliant idea for Mr Horse's birthday, but when their plan ends up in utter disaster, they'll need to travel the world and back to make things right again.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Rvr68u6k5sI\",\"name\":\"Official Final Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"bvomHFZO0mk\",\"name\":\"Official US \\\"Find Your Voice\\\" Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"T